  compactSize: {x: 880, y: 56}
  helmPosition: {x: 975, y: 725}
  helmSize: {x: 340, y: 245}
  instructions:
  - step: 0
    text: "Ch\xE0o m\u1EEBng l\xEAn t\xE0u! M\u1EDF B\xC0N L\xC1I v\xE0 l\xE0m theo
      checklist.\nB\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECF qua l\u1EDDi tho\u1EA1i; c\xE1c
      thao t\xE1c ph\u1EA3i t\u1EF1 th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh."
  - step: 1
    text: "M\u1EDF B\xC0N L\xC1I. H\xE3y cho t\xE0u di chuy\u1EC3n, \u0111\u1ED5i
      h\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xE0 thay \u0111\u1ED5i \u0111\u1ED9 s\xE2u. Quan s\xE1t t\u1ECDa
      \u0111\u1ED9, la b\xE0n v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED9 s\xE2u; quay v\u1EC1 cabin b\u1EA5t
      c\u1EE9 l\xFAc n\xE0o b\u1EB1ng ESC."
  - step: 2
    text: "M\u1EDF B\u1EA2N \u0110\u1ED2 \u0111\u1EC3 xem c\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m
      kh\u1EA3o s\xE1t. B\u1EA1n v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 quay l\u1EA1i b\xE0n l\xE1i.
      Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n b\u1EA5m h\u1EBFt c\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m; h\xE3y
      d\xF9ng t\u1ECDa \u0111\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EC3 l\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng."
  - step: 3
    text: "M\u1EDF RADAR v\xE0 b\u1EA5m QU\xC9T. M\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t qu\xE9t
      th\u1EADt s\u1EBD d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t radar. T\xEDn hi\u1EC7u gi\xFAp
      b\u1EA1n t\xECm m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu khi ti\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m
      tr\xEAn b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3."
  - step: 4
    text: "T\xECm m\u1ED9t m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh \u1EDF Zone01, \u0111\u01B0a
      t\xE0u t\u1EDBi g\u1EA7n v\xE0 h\u01B0\u1EDBng camera v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa n\xF3
      \u1EDF \u0111\u1ED9 s\xE2u kh\u1EA3o s\xE1t. D\xF9ng m\xE1y \u1EA3nh v\u1EADt
      l\xFD trong cabin \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EE5p. Ch\u1EC9 \u1EA3nh h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7
      m\u1EDBi c\xF3 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5; ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh ch\u01B0a
      ho\xE0n th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5."
  - step: 5
    text: "M\u1EDF COMPUTER \u2192 PHOTO LAB. Ch\u1ECDn \u1EA3nh c\xF3 d\xF2ng MISSION
      DATA DETECTED r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m SEND. G\u1EEDi d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u th\xE0nh c\xF4ng
      m\u1EDBi ho\xE0n th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh."
  - step: 6
    text: "\u0110\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m 02, ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn v\u1EADt
      ph\u1EA9m \u1EDF \u0111\u1ED9 s\xE2u kh\u1EA3o s\xE1t v\xE0 d\xF9ng thi\u1EBFt
      b\u1ECB CAPTURE trong cabin. Ho\xE0n th\xE0nh thao t\xE1c thu th\u1EADp \u0111\u1EC3
      nh\u1EADn b\u1EA3n thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF Emma. Sau \u0111\xF3 t\u1EF1 ch\u1EE5p
      v\xE0 SEND \u1EA3nh \u1EDF \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m c\xF2n l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng
      c\xE1c thao t\xE1c v\u1EEBa h\u1ECDc."
  - step: 7
    text: "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\xE0 b\u1EA3n thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EE7.
      M\u1EDF COMPUTER \u2192 UPGRADE, ch\u1ECDn EXPEDITION MODULE trong m\u1EE5c
      MODULES r\u1ED3i l\u1EAFp PRESSURE HULL. Th\u1EBB HULL REINFORCEMENT l\xE0
      n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p HP ri\xEAng; ch\u1EC9 m\u1EDF \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng ch\u01B0a
      ho\xE0n th\xE0nh b\u01B0\u1EDBc n\xE0y."
  - step: 8
    text: "Pressure Hull \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EAFp. B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3
      bi\u1EBFt c\xE1ch \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n, kh\u1EA3o s\xE1t, g\u1EEDi \u1EA3nh
      v\xE0 thu th\u1EADp. T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB v\xE0 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng
      \u0111\xE3 m\u1EDF; h\xE3y \u0111i t\u1EDBi l\u1ED1i ra \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp
      t\u1EE5c chuy\u1EBFn th\xE1m hi\u1EC3m."
